    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280490/extras/9a976df239332ad5bcfaa7f64a6670b8.avif?t=1753267003\" width=600 height=116 /></span><br><br>TekRobot is a platformer about a robot who faces great injustice. The game was created with a focus on a beautiful and distinctive style, with attention to detail. The gameplay is based on parkour and overcoming complex traps that require a strategic approach to progress.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Beautiful visual style<br></li><li> Atmospheric music<br></li><li> Convenient and responsive controls<br></li><li> Handcrafted thematic levels</li></ul> <br>The game interface deserves special attention, it features a unique design in a glassmorphism style, is aimed at improving the user experience with the TekRobot game, making it pleasant to use every part of the game, be it the menu, pause screen, or settings.<br><br><strong> \u2013 Menu</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280490/extras/760c1e3ee747ed532dc3b918fb5e8503.avif?t=1753267003\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><strong> \u2013 Pause</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280490/extras/ce6e43c3aca9d2f5b87dc6e686bdd958.avif?t=1753267003\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>",
